This is patch directory

Layout: one subdirectory per repo (path relative to the tree root),
numbered .patch files inside (git format, apply from the repo root).

Usage:

    cd WORKING_DIR
    sh device/xiaomi/mocha/patches/install.sh     # apply all patches
    sh device/xiaomi/mocha/patches/uninstall.sh   # revert all patches
    sh device/xiaomi/mocha/patches/check.sh       # verify only (no apply)

NOTE: uninstall.sh reverts via `git checkout -- . && git clean -df` in
each listed repo (destructive: also removes untracked files, including
this patches/ directory itself). Back it up before running.

Patches:

  bionic/libm/                     legacy vendor blob text relocations
  frameworks/av/                   Tegra software decoder, camera/media,
                                   stagefright tight, RGBA renderer
  frameworks/av.disabled/          (disabled: C2 soft decoders YV12/stall)
  frameworks/base/                 power Notifier NPE guard, ColorFade off
  frameworks/native/               GraphicBuffer ctor/null-guard, SF+binder
  hardware/interfaces/             Tegra camera session/provider/hwc2
  system/core/                     init zygote32 ld-preload shim, add_root
  system/extras/                   su from any uid
  packages/apps/Camera2/           selfie preview NPE fallback (front cam
                                   only advertises 4:3 previews), MediaStore
                                   JPEG write (FUSE), picsize debug log
  packages/apps/Gallery2/          video debug logging
  hardware/nvidia/hwcomposer/      Tegra build fixes
  hardware/broadcom/wlan/          wifi_hal use-after-free guard
  hardware/broadcom/fm/            FM libs buildable with the shared
                                   Broadcom BT/FM transport (non-proprietary,
                                   /system/lib)
  hardware/broadcom/libbt/         libbt-vendor BRCM_SHARED_TRANSPORT mode
                                   (UIM owns power/firmware/LPM)
  system/memory/lmkd/              workingset_refault counter wrap
  system/netd/                     NFLOG group removal
  system/connectivity/wificond/    BCM4350 ext-features log level
   system/sepolicy/                 webview_zygote pgroup rules
   system/bt/                      LDAC codec unavailable
   vendor/lineage/                 soong generated_kernel_headers stub

All patches above are committed in their respective repos (local
commits on top of upstream); the .patch files here are the persistent
record and the means to re-apply on a fresh tree.

NOTE: changes to this repo itself (device/xiaomi/mocha, e.g.
system_prop.mk) are normal commits, not patches, and are pushed to the
device repo remote directly.
